# .gitignore — ISO/IEC 42001 AIMS-in-a-Box
# This is a static HTML + Markdown product: no node_modules, no build output, no env files exist
# in this folder today. Keep this list short and accurate to what's actually here rather than
# pasting in a generic Node/Python/whatever template with rules that don't apply.

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor/IDE swap and backup files
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/

# Office/Word lock files (created when a .docx in Documents/ is open)
~$*.docx
~$*.doc
~$*.xlsx

# Local scratch/drafts not meant to ship as part of the kit
*.scratch.md
/local-notes/

# Never commit a licensed copy of the standard itself (reference only, not for distribution)
ISO-IEC-42001*.pdf
iso42001-2023*.pdf

